      "language": "cpp",
      "content": "Servo sweep;\nvoid setup() { sweep.attach(D9); }\nvoid loop() {\n  for (int a = 0; a <= 180; a += 10) { sweep.write(a); delay(120); }\n  for (int a = 180; a >= 0; a -= 10) { sweep.write(a); delay(120); }\n}\n"
